               <head>The biographies of masters in the Lam rim lineage</head>
               <msContents>
                  <msItem xml:id="Tib_blockbooks_a_31_1-item1">
                     <title key="" xml:lang="bo">བྱང་ཆུབ་ལམ་གྱི་རིམ་པའི་བླ་མ་བརྒྱུད་པའི་རྣམ་པར་ཐར་པ་པདྨ་དཀར་པོའི་འཕྲེང་བ་བཞུགས་སོ༎</title>
                     <title key="">byang chub lam gyi rim pa'i bla ma brgyud pa'i rnam par thar pa pad+ma dkar po'i 'phreng ba bzhugs so//</title>
                     <title type="margin" xml:lang="bo">བཤྲེ་ཡ་པད་ཕྲེང</title>
                     <title type="margin">shre ya pad phreng</title>
                     <author key="person_2017054725">
                        <persName xml:lang="bo">བློ་བཟང་ཡེ་ཤེས</persName> (<persName>blo bzang ye shes</persName>)</author>
                     <incipit xml:lang="bo">bla ma dang lhag pa'i lha dbyer med pa la dus thams cad du gus pas skyabs su 'chi/ gang gi thugs rje'i bdud rtsi'i cha shas tsam/ /snying la reg pa'i gdung ba kun sel cing / /gsol ba btab na dngos grub kun stsol ba'i/ /rtsa brgyud bla ma rnams la gus pas 'dud/ /de la 'dir rang gzhan dad pa 'phel ba'i gsos 'debs su/ byang chub lam gyi rim pa'i bla ma rnams kyi rnam par thar pa mdor bsdus tsam zhig brjod pa la/</incipit>
                     <explicit xml:lang="bo">thun mong min pa'i nye brgyud kyi dbang du byas na/ rje bla ma ston pa sangs rgyas dang thugs rgyud gcig pa yin no zhes dbon sa yab sras kyi gsung las 'byung bas shes so/ zhes pa 'di ni ri khrod 'dzin pa'i dge slong dka' bcu blo bzang bzang pos nan tan chen pos bskul ba'i ngo ma chogs par yongs kyi dge ba'i bshes gnyen bsod nams grags pa'i gsung bgros bzhin chos smra ba'i btsun pa blo bzang ye shes kyis smras pa dge legs su gyur cig / mang+ga laM/ /</explicit>
                  </msItem>
               </msContents>
